## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to diagnose distributed tracing gaps in a Consul Connect mesh across data centers, focusing on sampling configuration, header propagation mechanisms, and identity propagation challenges—beyond basic TLS or DNS troubleshooting.

## Key Concepts

- Distributed tracing architecture in Consul Connect
- Envoy proxy trace headers (traceparent, tracestate, B3)
- Telemetry sampling strategies and backend health monitoring
- Cross-data center identity propagation and SPIFFE certificate management

